hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20943","Yunus and Husayn narrated to us, they said: Shayban narrated to us from Qatadah who said: I found Mirthad ibn Zabyan, he said: A letter came to us from the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and we found no scribe to read it to us until a man from Banu Dubayah read it: From the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, to Bakr ibn Wail: Submit and you will be safe."
